"{\"blocks\":[{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"I’d choose the Aeroplan economy award departing SFO at noon: among the complete shown choices it arrives earliest, and it has the shortest elapsed time. The tradeoff is an economy award with a TPE connection, not a nonstop; its CAD taxes quote has unknown scope, and the search does not establish current bookability.\"},{\"k\":\"p\",\"r\":\"J7@2027-01-15T12:00-08:00/SFO>BKK/E>2027-01-17T01:25\",\"n\":\"Aeroplan economy — earliest arrival\",\"v\":\"Departs January 15 at 12:00 p.m. from SFO and arrives January 17 at 1:25 a.m. in Bangkok, via TPE on BR. The award reports 65,000 Aeroplan points and CAD 116.50 in taxes; the amount’s quote scope is unknown, so it is not established as a per-person or total amount. The award reports one seat and passes the minimum-seat check for the requested one traveler, but this is not confirmation of current availability. The connection at TPE is 270 minutes. The reported cabin is economy; cabin by leg is not provided.\"},{\"k\":\"x\",\"r\":\"T15\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"Compared with the later Aeroplan option below, this arrives 15 hours 25 minutes earlier and takes 3 hours 55 minutes less elapsed time, while the shown Aeroplan points and CAD tax quote are the same raw amounts. The later option departs 11 hours 30 minutes later, but changes carriers and has a longer TPE connection.\"},{\"k\":\"a\",\"r\":\"J13@2027-01-15T23:30-08:00/SFO>BKK/E>2027-01-17T16:50\",\"n\":\"Aeroplan economy — later arrival, different carriers\",\"v\":\"Departs SFO at 11:30 p.m. January 15 and arrives Bangkok at 4:50 p.m. January 17, via TPE on BR and TG. It reports 65,000 Aeroplan points and CAD 116.50 taxes, with unknown quote scope, and one reported seat; the minimum-seat check passes for the requested one traveler. Its TPE connection is 495 minutes. Economy is the reported award cabin, but cabin by leg is not provided. Consider it if the later departure suits you; it offers no lower reported Aeroplan points or taxes than 