rkish award requires more points and has unknown seat support and taxes. Its slower arrival and separate-ticket join are important downsides; the reported award cabin does not establish cabin on each leg.\"},{\"k\":\"a\",\"r\":\"J43@2027-01-15T06:18-08:00/SFO>BKK/B>2027-01-17T08:50\",\"n\":\"Turkish business via separate LAX positioning\",\"v\":\"Departs SFO at 6:18 a.m. January 15 and arrives Bangkok at 8:50 a.m. January 17, with 2,132 minutes elapsed. The reported award is Turkish business at 275,000 points, with taxes and reliable seat counts unavailable; award support for the requested one traveler is unverified. The separate Alaska SFO–LAX cash component is quoted at USD 86.00, with unknown scope, so it is not a total trip cost. The LAX join is 299 minutes and is not evidence of protected connections or permission to position. The award connects at IST for 420 minutes; cabin by leg is not provided.\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"For a cash-only reference, the selected SFO–BKK itinerary includes one stop. Its USD quote also has unknown scope, so it is a baseline quote rather than a confirmed party total or like-for-like comparison with award taxes.\"},{\"k\":\"b\",\"r\":\"C1@2027-01-15T09:40-08:00/SFO>BKK\",\"n\":\"Cash baseline — Singapore Airlines\",\"v\":\"The search shows a one-stop Singapore Airlines cash itinerary from SFO via SIN to BKK, departing January 15 at 9:40 a.m. and arriving January 17 at 8:25 a.m. The source quote is USD 440.00 with unknown scope; it is not established as a per-traveler or total amount.\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"Shared limits: search results were partial and observed October 9, 2026; some availability may not be real-time. Confirm current schedules, award availability, seats, taxes, cash prices, and booking terms with the relevant providers before booking. The search reports 258 selectable journeys overall, but these displayed choices are selected examples, not a complete inventory.\"}]}"
